    - If `nums[i] != nums[k - 2]`, the current element can be allowed in the result array.
- **Main Idea**: This check ensures that any element is only repeated up to two times.

### 4. **Modify the array in-place and update `k`**
```python
nums[k] = nums[i]
k += 1
